    "html": "<div class=\"cs\"><div class=\"cs-hero\"><div class=\"cs-label\">OBJECTIVE</div><div class=\"cs-big\">To introduce the Claims Specialist Role and help participants gain a clear understanding of the key responsibilities and expectations within this position.</div></div></div>"
